usage: plan.py link [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] --kind
                    {depends_on,related,decision,applies_to,unit_depends_on}
                    [--relation RELATION] [--note NOTE]
                    plan from to

add a typed link between two documents of the plan; a repeat is a no-op

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path
  from                  owning document: Pn, Pn.m, D#, Pn.m/U# or
                        knowledge/<id>
  to                    linked document in the same plan

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --kind {depends_on,related,decision,applies_to,unit_depends_on}
  --relation RELATION   related only:
                        informs|consumes|conflicts|follows_up|supersedes
  --note NOTE           related only: why linked
